// The M2Shared domain: seams on CM2Shared, the part of an M2 model every instance of it shares.

#ifndef WXL_SEAM_BEFORE
#error "define WXL_SEAM_BEFORE(domain, name, symbol, ret, conv, params) before including m2shared.def"
#endif

// The end of a model file's read. CM2Shared::Load (0x0083D410) sizes the buffer and queues an
// asynchronous read of the whole file into it; when the read is done, the client's poll of the
// read queue (AsyncFileReadPollHandler) calls this with the model, on the main thread, and it
// goes on to FinishLoading, which parses the bytes in place (M2Init). So this is the one moment
// the file's bytes are all there and nothing has read them yet.
//
// Before raises ModelLoad with the model's path, its bytes and their size. A handler may answer
// with other bytes (wxl_model_load_args::replacement and replacement_size, native mods only):
// they are copied into a buffer of the client's own allocator, which takes the place of the
// one read, and the client parses those instead.
//
// cdecl, a static taking the model as its one argument: [ebp+8] is read, and the function leaves
// by a tail jump to FinishLoading (0x0083D35E), so it has no `ret` of its own. Reached only
// through the read's callback pointer: the witness is that call.
WXL_SEAM_BEFORE(M2Shared, LoadSucceededCallback, "CM2Shared::LoadSucceededCallback", void, cdecl, (void* param))
WXL_SEAM_WITNESS(M2Shared, LoadSucceededCallback, 0x004B9B9E)    // AsyncFileReadPollHandler: call ecx; add esp, 4
WXL_SEAM_RAISES(M2Shared, LoadSucceededCallback, ModelLoad)

// A model's skin profile, its .skin file read: CM2Shared::LoadSkinProfile (0x0083CB40) reads it
// whole into m_skinData by an asynchronous read, whose callback calls this with the file's size;
// it then parses the profile in place (M2Init). Before raises SkinProfileLoad with the model's
// path and the skin's bytes, only while someone listens. thiscall, the model in ECX, the size on
// the stack (`ret 4`).
WXL_SEAM_BEFORE(M2Shared, FinishLoadingSkinProfile, "CM2Shared::FinishLoadingSkinProfile", int32_t, thiscall, (void* self, uint32_t size))
WXL_SEAM_RAISES(M2Shared, FinishLoadingSkinProfile, SkinProfileLoad)
